From 395d3c7a8e79ec6160a4173722be55f345b6bf4e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Benjamin Tan <benjamin@dev.ofcr.se>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 1970 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: cli: git: add raw ref fetch command

Reviewers often need commits from forge refs such as
`refs/pull/123/head`

Add `jj git ref fetch` for one raw ref or full commit ID from a named
remote. The command reports the imported commit and leaves it visible
without a bookmark, remote-tracking ref, or durable raw ref name

Use the fetch configuration only when it matches one remote. Require
`--remote` when it matches more than one remote

Refs #4388

Co-authored-by: 4evy <git@evy.pink>

